{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 46, :comments ["<b>And you stayed in Kadesh many days.</b> Nineteen years — for it is said <b>as the days that you stayed</b> in the rest of the journeys, and those were 38 years; 19 of them they spent in Kadesh, and 19 years they went about wandering and returned to Kadesh, as is said (Numbers 32) ״וַיְנִיעֵם בַּמִּדְבָּר״; thus I found in Seder Olam."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:45:36.823177756Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}